{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30978887"}, "name":{"label":"showmaker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-01-16T07:32:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"3657055732"}, "title":{"label":"Almost there"}, "content":{"label":"I’m quite pleased with this well designed app and it’s meditative nature sounds except for the thunder sound which is not realistic sounding and the fact that the app stops playing if you try to add some background music from iTunes, Pandora or other music player apps. Simultaneously playing two separate sound apps together technically IS possible on an iOS device as other ambiance apps can do it or they have an “add background music” feature (the Coffitivity coffee shop app can do both) —  so it somewhat disappointed me to discover that Noisli could do neither. Add that feature guys and improve the thunder sounds and I’ll give you 5 stars!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id440406232"}, "name":{"label":"Jdfdjgk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-01-14T10:16:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"3650027372"}, "title":{"label":"Helpful, with audio issues"}, "content":{"label":"A very helpful app for drowning out the noise from an open office format. \n\nThere seem to be a few audio tracks that have other noises in them. I believe the rain or thunder tracks have violin (or something) notes in the background. \n\nJust an example, but fixing this would be helpful. This issue snaps me out of focus every time, which seems to be about every 15 minutes or so.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id165213902"}, "name":{"label":"Peggy A."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-01-14T01:00:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"3648460609"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty good but this is worth noting..."}, "content":{"label":"I only use the rain sound, but there’s this strange, ambient noise in the background. It’s faint, but I notice it every time. It sounds like a synth or something, and it goes from one note to another, a whole step apart. I find it pretty distracting, but it’s not a big deal. I still really like the app, but if you like rain noise like me, I’d just use a YouTube video because this faint noise is strange.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
