{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id124572341"}, "name":{"label":"frankjc3"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-06-28T05:54:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"2788586486"}, "title":{"label":"Well designed app that lacks updates and active development"}, "content":{"label":"My ideal app would provide me a passive soundscape I can easily work to. If I could mix this app’s design with Coffitivity’s function, that would be what I’m looking for.  \n\nThe app is beautiful and wonderfully designed. However, there is little development on this app with no updates or  new version in over a year. But for 1.99, most people will be satisfied with the app as is.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id257609917"}, "name":{"label":"twoifiplay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-06-10T19:14:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"2674102566"}, "title":{"label":"Browser is best, then android, then ios"}, "content":{"label":"I got Noisli as the Chrome extension. It was great. 5/5 stars. So I paid for it.\n\nThen I got it for Android and paid for it again. It was fine but didn’t take advantage of the OS (there’s no “playing” notification so you can’t easily turn it up or down or find it like every other sound making app). Fine, 3/5 stars.\n\nThen I paid for it on ios. It has an ipad app but it doesn’t align horizontally. The max 6 combos is immediately apparent (why limit it?). It’s small stuff but it amounts to a lousy experience when I’m writing.\n\nTaken that I’ve paid 3 times for this app, 2 stars seems fair.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id102514462"}, "name":{"label":"Fr3aky"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2018-04-07T10:00:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"2395094890"}, "title":{"label":"Air Pod Incompatible?"}, "content":{"label":"I didn’t think this was even possible, but Noisli just refuses to work with my Air Pods. I have an iPhone 6s+ and have been using Noisli for years and loving it but for some reason I get no audio output when using my Air Pods. I’d love to rate higher, and other headphones work well, but for some reason Noisli just doesn’t want to output to my Air Pods.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
