{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id175874316"}, "name":{"label":"Shortydwop"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-02T15:09:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1710084608"}, "title":{"label":"Timer modification"}, "content":{"label":"I was introduced to Noisli as a (free) Chrome extension and love it primarily for the ability to set the timer to any amount of time I want. I was excited to find this iOS counterpart and didn't hesitate to pay $1.99 because my iPhone is where I would use the timer most, whereas my laptop is where I would use the white noise most. I expected this pay version to have at least the same features I got from the free app. BUYER BEWARE! It turns out this iOS app does not have a customizable timer and now I have paid for an app that doesn't do as much as its free version.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"5"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"5"}}, 
