{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id292468770"}, "name":{"label":"AshFallenBrightly"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-20T08:58:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1593488456"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent ! Needs more sound packs"}, "content":{"label":"Use it to sleep every night via a Bluetooth speaker system - perhaps add more sounds & sound variations 😉\n\nP.S. THANK YOU for finally adding the ability for, it to play with other audio apps to mix things up more ! Now, I'll use it every single night 👍", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24456929"}, "name":{"label":"Cordial Savage"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-19T15:46:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.4"}, "id":{"label":"1592859358"}, "title":{"label":"Need updates"}, "content":{"label":"***2017 and no updated sounds or quality: uhhh? This app has become a 255+ MB space waster on my phone. Actual good updates ever to be in the works? It's boring!!!***\n\nIt's good but needs work.\n\n1. I wish it didn't take up so much space.\n\n2. Also, it needs some more choices on sounds, like ZzzZzz offers. Wind chimes and monk chant would be great. That one is a Noisli ripoff, but with more options.\n\nI like this app, but it's really limited and needs more options. Until then...deleted.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id23029624"}, "name":{"label":"Mightym@x2017"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-04-16T11:28:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"1590444504"}, "title":{"label":"Great for work!!!"}, "content":{"label":"I'm a software developer and need to concentrate. My coworkers are very loud and noisy. This app has been a life saver for me. I love how you can mix different ambient sounds with white noise and control how loud each one plays. \n\nHaving this has allowed me to focus on my code and not feel like screaming at people. \n\nDefinitely a must get if you're trying to drown out noise and concentrate.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=862773459&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
